  "downloads": 4219,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Includes 5 camos, 16 stickers, and 5 presets :)</p>\n<p>Some Camos I made cause I like anime and stuff.</p>\n<p>Not really made for “tacticoolness”</p>\n<p>Feel free to comment any suggestions!</p>\n<p>Feel Free to @ me on the SPT discord and share your creations :D</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Camos</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>UPD: 1.1\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6916ec61-ab0c-4415-a82f-0f7640461901\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21878ea3-fe40-418a-8fb0-de5a58272a79\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p>UPD 1.0\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62ccd2c8-1017-4426-8d93-6daa9313b219\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2158b844-343c-46e4-b42f-be097d407dc1\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91431c20-7e62-420c-a64f-f59c2508ee5b\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/698f6ad8-f044-4fa4-854f-d2f55d4ccc23\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d2080ff-c1fe-4550-9dc3-212a243fd9f6\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Stickers</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Most Stickers in this pack are pinups based on my OC Evelyn and a bunch of miscellaneous others.</p>\n<p>Will add more, but I ran out of Ideas :p</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/033c9bf7-1023-472e-8175-981c5692e079\" alt=\"Preview\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Download Dependency:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2658/weapon-camo-and-stickers#description\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Weapon Camos and Stickers</a></p>\n<p>Download this Mod</p>\n<p>Take BepinEx and Copy to SPT folder</p></div></div></div>\n",
